  "description": "Return to the rails of Great Western Railway and revisit Train Sim World’s first ever UK route with the completely overhauled free update to Great Western Express! Re-experience the route like you’ve never seen it before, with new and improved scenery, modern TSW features, train upgrades and more, brought to you by Grump Dog Games.\n\nHeading out of London and running due west at speed, the Great Western Main Line is the key corridor between the Capital, the Thames Valley and out into the far reaches of the West Country & Wales. Engineered by Isambard Kingdom Brunel, the Great Western Railway laid the foundations for what would become one of Britain’s busiest railways."
